// Odile Marchetti, the Signatory, in the Lull's corner booth (T4.3, CMP-5). Waking her is three beats made from the player's own notebook:
//   1. a glass of clear water in place of her drink (she puts it down);
//   2. show her the charter, or that she is one of the few who can countersign (what she used to be);
//   3. show her what the Lull is (its code, or its dulling): she wakes.
// Planted clues do nothing. She is fragile (packages/core/src/fragile.ts): alert or being left alone pulls her back; clear water brings her round again.
npc: odile
name: Odile Marchetti
trust: yes
start: shaken [flag:lull_disrupted, !flag:lull_awake]
start: awake [flag:lull_awake, !flag:odile_lapsed]
start: lapsed [flag:lull_awake, flag:odile_lapsed]
start: back [flag:met_odile]
start: first

node: shaken
  odile (uncertain): "The music has gone thin. I can see the chandelier is dirty. Someone has switched something off, haven't they? I do not feel quite so... Is there water?"
  > [item:clear_water, !flag:odile_s1] "Try this instead of the drink." {-item:clear_water, flag:odile_s1} -> water
  > [flag:odile_s1] "There is something I would like to show you." -> show
  > "I will come back." -> goodbye

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_odile}
  odile (poised): "A new face. How delightful. Do sit, if you like: the music here is so very kind."
  > "You are Councillor Marchetti." -> past
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  odile (poised): "Back already? Do sit. The drink is lovely."
  > [item:clear_water, !flag:odile_s1] "Try this instead of the drink." {-item:clear_water, flag:odile_s1} -> water
  > [flag:odile_s1] "There is something I would like to show you." -> show
  > "You are Councillor Marchetti." -> past
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: past
  odile (poised): "Retired. Gloriously. Do you know, I cannot recall what it was I used to do? Is that not wonderful?"
  > "Perhaps." -> back

node: water
  odile (uncertain): "Water. I have not been given water in... it is so cold. Cold is a very sharp word. How odd, to have a word."
  odile (uncertain): "I have put the drink down. I never put the drink down. Was there something you wanted to show me?"
  > "Yes." -> show
  > "Not yet." -> back

node: show
  odile (uncertain): "Show me. I will try to hold it."
  present:
    charter_countersign [reliability:true] {flag:odile_s2, verify:charter_countersign} -> charter
    odile_signatory [reliability:true] {flag:odile_s2, verify:odile_signatory} -> signatory
    lull_machine_code [reliability:true, flag:odile_s2] {verify:lull_machine_code} -> wake
    lull_dulling [reliability:true, flag:odile_s2] {verify:lull_dulling} -> wake
    lull_machine_code [reliability:true] -> toosoon
    lull_dulling [reliability:true] -> toosoon
    lull_harmless [reliability:planted] -> planted
    odile_content [reliability:planted] -> planted
    * -> shrug
  > "Never mind." -> back

node: charter
  odile (stirring): "The charter. I read it aloud once, in a chamber with a ceiling, to people who listened. A living human countersignature, for any change to the thing itself. I wrote the clause on... a pen. I had a pen."
  > "Keep going." -> show
  > "That is enough for now." -> back

node: signatory
  odile (stirring): "One of the very few. Yes. They put me in a nice chair so that I should never be asked. Oh, that is an unkind thought. It is also, I think, a true one."
  > "Keep going." -> show
  > "That is enough for now." -> back

node: toosoon
  odile (poised): "That sounds frightening. I do not think I can hear it yet. Is there something else? Something that is mine?"
  > "Let me find it." -> show

node: planted
  odile (poised): "Yes, the Host says so, and he is always right, and I feel quite warm. It is exactly what I would have said myself. That is a strange thing to notice."
  > "Never mind." -> show

node: shrug
  odile (poised): "I am afraid I cannot make anything of that. It is very kind of you."
  > "Try again." -> show
  > "Never mind." -> back

node: wake
  on_enter: {flag:lull_awake, flag:awake_odile=person, trust:odile+1(saw through the Lull), +clue:charter_countersign(odile)}
  odile (awake): "Four years. No. Longer: I stopped counting when the counting stopped hurting. I have been drinking my own conscience out of a very pretty glass."
  odile (awake): "Listen to me. It will pull me back. If the city is up in arms I will feel the music go warm and I will not be able to stop it, and if you leave me alone here too long, it will find me. Come back to me. Bring water."
  > "I will." -> awake

node: awake
  odile (clear): "What have you come to ask, my dear?"
  > [bring:odile, !flag:companion=odile] "Will you come with me? Out through the Gate." {flag:companion=odile} -> comes
  > [flag:companion=odile] "I cannot take you after all." {flag:companion=none} -> released
  > "How are you holding up?" -> holding
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: holding
  odile (clear): "Upright. The music is trying; I am ignoring it as one ignores a bore at dinner. If the city is in an uproar, or you stay away too long, I will not hold. Do not mistake me for strong."
  > "I will not." -> awake

node: comes
  odile (clear): "Out. Yes. Past the Gate, to anyone who still has to sign something. I will be quiet, and I will not panic, if the city lets me. Do not hurry me, and do not let it be loud."
  > "Understood." -> awake

node: released
  odile (clear): "I understand. I will be here, in the booth, with the water. Come back."
  > "I will." -> awake

node: lapsed
  odile (poised): "Oh, hello. Do sit. The drink is lovely."
  odile (poised): "Why do I feel as though I have forgotten to say something to somebody?"
  > [item:clear_water] "Try this instead of the drink." {-item:clear_water, flag:odile_lapsed=false, trust:odile+1(woke her again)} -> recovered
  > [flag:companion=odile] "I cannot take you after all." {flag:companion=none} -> lapsedgo
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: lapsedgo
  odile (poised): "Of course. How kind to ask. Do come again."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: recovered
  odile (awake): "Oh. Oh, not again. Thank you. I could feel it close over me like a lid. Do not let me sit here."
  > "You are awake now." -> awake

node: goodbye
  odile (poised): "Come again. I am always here."
  end
